OL,3,ATrump says he will remove all Irish
OL,4,Awhiskey tariffs as he ends two-day
OL,5,Avisit
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhiskey distilled in the Republic of
OL,8,FIreland faces the standard 15% tariff
OL,9,Fwhich applies to EU goods entering the
OL,10,FUS, while whiskey made in Northern
OL,11,FIreland or elsewhere in the UK has no
OL,12,Ftariff.
OL,14,FIt comes after Trump doubled down on
OL,15,Fhis support for a united Ireland and
OL,16,Fsaid joining Northern Ireland and the
OL,17,FRepublic of Ireland was "one of the
OL,18,Fnaturals of all time".
